# Review stewardship（reviewer）

Default: report in chat. Persist via `review-record` when needed.

Narrow defects → **`hotfixer`**. Large gaps → **`plan_slicer`** / **`builder`**.

## When to use

- PDCA **Check** after **Do**
- User asks for review / PR check
- Verify acceptance criteria in code · **factor coverage** · no recognition→class force

## Skills

| Purpose | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Context | `review-reference` |
| Conduct | `review-conduct` |
| Record | `review-record` |
| Role | **`reviewer`** |

## Boundaries

| Need | Prefer |
|------|--------|
| Progress / health | `evaluator` |
| Plan rewrite | `plan_slicer` |
| Spec gap · semantics drift | `spec_designer` |

Semantics: [`docs/DESIGN_SEMANTICS.md`](../docs/DESIGN_SEMANTICS.md)
